(6482817, 964115, 96751, '<td valign="top">Holy Toledo.  The lighting on this is extraordinary. Front page material. Looks like you put yourself in harm''s way for this shot.  What an angry ocean in the bg, and that sky.  But to capture that wave at the moment of cresting... Wow. Straight to faves.</td>', 'Holy Toledo.  The lighting on this is extraordinary. Front page material. Looks like you put yourself in harm''s way for this shot.  What an angry ocean in the bg, and that sky.  But to capture that wave at the moment of cresting... Wow. Straight to faves.', '2011-07-27 21:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6482818, 964044, 96751, '<td valign="top">That''s not what this image portrays for me.  I quite enjoy the bug macro and the very shallow dof, but the title makes it feel like a shoehorn.</td>', 'That''s not what this image portrays for me.  I quite enjoy the bug macro and the very shallow dof, but the title makes it feel like a shoehorn.', '2011-07-27 21:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
