(6483021, 963892, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. Much symbolism in this. Comp is good. Has God left us? The lighting from above hint not. The state of the building tells another story.. It''s always man that vacates the estate and the prodigal son needs to return and get''s his house in order. Im over analizing but there you have it. It''s only because I like this shot 8</td>', 'Lovely shot. Much symbolism in this. Comp is good. Has God left us? The lighting from above hint not. The state of the building tells another story.. It''s always man that vacates the estate and the prodigal son needs to return and get''s his house in order. Im over analizing but there you have it. It''s only because I like this shot 8', '2011-07-28 02:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483035, 963303, 108525, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot with good lighting. I hope it does better than my last patriotic shot. DPC voters don''t seem to like patriotism.</td>', 'This is a great shot with good lighting. I hope it does better than my last patriotic shot. DPC voters don''t seem to like patriotism.', '2011-07-28 04:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
