(6483271, 963846, 86218, '<td valign="top">Very funny and original. Nicely executed. Light may be a bit harsh for my taste but it goes down as a shot to remember for me</td>', 'Very funny and original. Nicely executed. Light may be a bit harsh for my taste but it goes down as a shot to remember for me', '2011-07-28 14:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
