(6483401, 963846, 40391, '<td valign="top">This was my only 10 for the challenge as it really appeals to me.  The composition is great but its the cats expression that really appeals to me.  The shadows work well for me too.  Its a pity her right hand has slight motion blur but I doubt you could redo the shot and get the cat to give that look again.  Well done!</td>', 'This was my only 10 for the challenge as it really appeals to me.  The composition is great but its the cats expression that really appeals to me.  The shadows work well for me too.  Its a pity her right hand has slight motion blur but I doubt you could redo the shot and get the cat to give that look again.  Well done!', '2011-07-28 20:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
