(6484980, 963549, 70921, '<td valign="top">Good diagonal leading line of building.  I''d crop out the distracting elements at far right... It''s a photo of a wall and the pole and wires at end don''t add anything to the composition.</td>', 'Good diagonal leading line of building.  I''d crop out the distracting elements at far right... It''s a photo of a wall and the pole and wires at end don''t add anything to the composition.', '2011-07-30 13:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484981, 963735, 70921, '<td valign="top">Good composition with subject NOT dead centered.  I''d still crop a little at right... just seems to be too much tree.  Background a little distracting with hot spots but good lighting on subject.</td>', 'Good composition with subject NOT dead centered.  I''d still crop a little at right... just seems to be too much tree.  Background a little distracting with hot spots but good lighting on subject.', '2011-07-30 13:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484984, 963984, 70921, '<td valign="top">That floating cup in background draws me away from the main subject. Good composition with just a little of the man so as to support the main subject but not overpower it.  Great expression of subject and good focus.  I''d crop bottom almost at kids hand and crop some water off the right side and get the kids head off dead center in the photo.  You might also "flip" the photo so the man is on the right side of the photo so when the eye comes in from the left of the photo it sees the kid first and the man last.</td>', 'That floating cup in background draws me away from the main subject. Good composition with just a little of the man so as to support the main subject but not overpower it.  Great expression of subject and good focus.  I''d crop bottom almost at kids hand and crop some water off the right side and get the kids head off dead center in the photo.  You might also "flip" the photo so the man is on the right side of the photo so when the eye comes in from the left of the photo it sees the kid first and the man last.', '2011-07-30 13:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484986, 964073, 70921, '<td valign="top">Good action shot with sharp focus and good exposure with details in both shadows and hightlights.</td>', 'Good action shot with sharp focus and good exposure with details in both shadows and hightlights.', '2011-07-30 13:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
