(6487464, 964066, 74911, '<td valign="top">Nice and funny. Good choice for meeting the challenge. <br/> <br/>I would have thought about choosing a relatively shorter title. This kind of gives a feeling that you are trying to convince the voters how this is meeting is the challenge and not a force-fit.</td>', 'Nice and funny. Good choice for meeting the challenge.  I would have thought about choosing a relatively shorter title. This kind of gives a feeling that you are trying to convince the voters how this is meeting is the challenge and not a force-fit.', '2011-08-01 18:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487465, 964031, 74911, '<td valign="top">Title of your image and the shot itself goes very well with this challenge. What did not work well here is the lighting, background and the overall colors. The shot looks more like a snapshot of two dogs playing, that is found to be a fit for this challenge. The background looks cluttered. The lighting seems to have been from the built-in flash, which is right on the face of the two dogs, which is not really pleasing or flattering. Overall a timely capture that suits the challenge and title. Good luck!</td>', 'Title of your image and the shot itself goes very well with this challenge. What did not work well here is the lighting, background and the overall colors. The shot looks more like a snapshot of two dogs playing, that is found to be a fit for this challenge. The background looks cluttered. The lighting seems to have been from the built-in flash, which is right on the face of the two dogs, which is not really pleasing or flattering. Overall a timely capture that suits the challenge and title. Good luck!', '2011-08-01 18:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487466, 964110, 74911, '<td valign="top">Great capture and a great title. Like how one bird is entering the territory, with some motion blur and the other one looks at it. Composition is clean and pleasing. Should do well. Good luck!</td>', 'Great capture and a great title. Like how one bird is entering the territory, with some motion blur and the other one looks at it. Composition is clean and pleasing. Should do well. Good luck!', '2011-08-01 18:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487467, 963984, 74911, '<td valign="top">Good fit for the challenge. Cure expression from the kid. I can see how this relates to the title. Great. I think the blue water portion at the bottom of the frame is too much. I would have cropped some more at the bottom to show more of the people and some water around the kid.</td>', 'Good fit for the challenge. Cure expression from the kid. I can see how this relates to the title. Great. I think the blue water portion at the bottom of the frame is too much. I would have cropped some more at the bottom to show more of the people and some water around the kid.', '2011-08-01 18:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487468, 964073, 74911, '<td valign="top">Great choice for the challenge. Good job on freezing the action. The only thing is that the harsh light was not in your favor. There is too much of blow-out highlights on the water portion.</td>', 'Great choice for the challenge. Good job on freezing the action. The only thing is that the harsh light was not in your favor. There is too much of blow-out highlights on the water portion.', '2011-08-01 18:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487469, 963735, 74911, '<td valign="top">Concept is good, fits the challenge very well. Good title.</td>', 'Concept is good, fits the challenge very well. Good title.', '2011-08-01 18:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487470, 963334, 74911, '<td valign="top">Not sure if maternity is a sense. It is like a stage in a woman''s life, right? A sense to me sounds more like an abstract feeling. I may be ignorant about it and totally wrong. But, just expressing what I think.</td>', 'Not sure if maternity is a sense. It is like a stage in a woman''s life, right? A sense to me sounds more like an abstract feeling. I may be ignorant about it and totally wrong. But, just expressing what I think.', '2011-08-01 18:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487471, 964018, 74911, '<td valign="top">Good use of shallow depth of field. Great processing.</td>', 'Good use of shallow depth of field. Great processing.', '2011-08-01 18:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487472, 963753, 74911, '<td valign="top">Good choice. I can see that she is crying because of some kind of pain, either physical or mental. Good exposure and clarity, especially the eyes. I do not if the cry was real, if not, a good show by the model. :)</td>', 'Good choice. I can see that she is crying because of some kind of pain, either physical or mental. Good exposure and clarity, especially the eyes. I do not if the cry was real, if not, a good show by the model. :)', '2011-08-01 18:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487473, 963634, 74911, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I can immediately associate the image with the title. Great execution.</td>', 'Beautiful. I can immediately associate the image with the title. Great execution.', '2011-08-01 18:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487474, 964099, 74911, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture. Like the tones and lighting here. Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful capture. Like the tones and lighting here. Good luck!', '2011-08-01 18:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487475, 963969, 74911, '<td valign="top">Good choice for the challenge. Like how you have laid the focus on the tip of the needle and the way in which the syringe is coming into the frame diagonally. What did not work for me in this image is the overall exposure and white balance. The whole image looks a bit flat to me. Because of the light background the small drop in front of the needle is almost lost.</td>', 'Good choice for the challenge. Like how you have laid the focus on the tip of the needle and the way in which the syringe is coming into the frame diagonally. What did not work for me in this image is the overall exposure and white balance. The whole image looks a bit flat to me. Because of the light background the small drop in front of the needle is almost lost.', '2011-08-01 18:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487476, 964042, 74911, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, composition and pose. Like the clever title too.</td>', 'Nice colors, composition and pose. Like the clever title too.', '2011-08-01 18:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
