(6489320, 963634, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful and minimal. Hope this ribbons.<br/>Might be slightly better if it felt a little more real rather than surreal - maybe if there were something that indicates it''s actually in water and not a photoshopped reflection?</td>', 'Very peaceful and minimal. Hope this ribbons.Might be slightly better if it felt a little more real rather than surreal - maybe if there were something that indicates it''s actually in water and not a photoshopped reflection?', '2011-08-02 19:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489323, 963698, 59796, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I hope it ribbons. <br/>I wish the warm hues extended all the way instead of the dull color at the very top. Also, the sun shape looks a bit odd instead of a perfect circle?</td>', 'Beautiful! I hope it ribbons. I wish the warm hues extended all the way instead of the dull color at the very top. Also, the sun shape looks a bit odd instead of a perfect circle?', '2011-08-02 19:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489331, 964087, 59796, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I hope this ribbons.<br/>The harsh shadows in the foreground are a little too contrasty to give the sense of tranquility, but everything else in the picture does. Maybe if the picture were cropped from the bottom slightly to remove the shadows, it would look even better?</td>', 'Beautiful! I hope this ribbons.The harsh shadows in the foreground are a little too contrasty to give the sense of tranquility, but everything else in the picture does. Maybe if the picture were cropped from the bottom slightly to remove the shadows, it would look even better?', '2011-08-02 19:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489332, 964040, 59796, '<td valign="top">Woah! From the thumbnail I thought this was a broken CD or something like that! Never seen a web that''s so dense. Beautiful craftsmanship, well captured in the backlight. Hope this gets the blue.</td>', 'Woah! From the thumbnail I thought this was a broken CD or something like that! Never seen a web that''s so dense. Beautiful craftsmanship, well captured in the backlight. Hope this gets the blue.', '2011-08-02 19:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
