(6489615, 964018, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure how to vote this one... The challenge is to represent a sense of something (other than the 5 senses), yet yours says it''s "not" the sense of something. It''s also not a 6th sense, and not a sense of foreboding. <br/> <br/>I really wish you would have come up with something -- sense of accomplishment? Sense of purpose? I think it''s an excellent shot. A 9 or 10 in my book, but I just don''t see that it fits the challenge.<br/> <br/>Usually if something doesn''t fit the challenge, I mark it down a bit. But every once in awhile I come across a photo that I can''t mark down, because I like it so much. And I can''t vote high, because it doesn''t seem fair to the ones who fit the challenge.<br/> <br/>So I don''t vote.<br/> <br/>I think it''s only happened three times that I remember.<br/> <br/>So I have to leave this with no vote (but I will fav it!)<br/> <br/>sorry...</td>', 'I''m not quite sure how to vote this one... The challenge is to represent a sense of something (other than the 5 senses), yet yours says it''s "not" the sense of something. It''s also not a 6th sense, and not a sense of foreboding.  I really wish you would have come up with something -- sense of accomplishment? Sense of purpose? I think it''s an excellent shot. A 9 or 10 in my book, but I just don''t see that it fits the challenge. Usually if something doesn''t fit the challenge, I mark it down a bit. But every once in awhile I come across a photo that I can''t mark down, because I like it so much. And I can''t vote high, because it doesn''t seem fair to the ones who fit the challenge. So I don''t vote. I think it''s only happened three times that I remember. So I have to leave this with no vote (but I will fav it!) sorry...', '2011-08-02 22:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
